{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_horn_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_horn_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"獨奏曲","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_horn_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"7f6818aaf5d18e9e9b9c4108140abbb943e72c75d4fb80f70cb0b9a54be213b3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"從小丘郡到倫蒂尼姆，號角一路痛苦著，仇恨著，卻依然做出了最理性的決策。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"narration","text":"（備忘錄的第一頁）\n三角鐵，小鼓，貝斯，曼陀林，大提琴，雙簧管。\n我不會忘記。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......蔓德拉長官真的那麼說了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，命令如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她竟然也去找什麼貴族！我跟著她難道不就是因為我不想被那些貴族老爺頤指氣使嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還警告我們不要對薩卡茲出言不遜？和那些魔族合作？開什麼玩笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官要是在場，你已經被穿在石柱上了，說話長點心吧。她有自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或者領袖有自己的想法，那樣你就更不應該多嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過來，維多利亞佬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官叫我們把你的鐐銬解開，你可以出去散散心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這又是什麼把戲？你們想在背後用弩指著我，透過看我逃跑來取樂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們可以試試，結局會讓你們失望的——或者你們都沒命去失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你聽，這傢伙嘴還是這麼硬，和所有的維多利亞佬一樣傲慢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你說的不算全錯，如果你以為自己能逃跑，那你確實該看看自己能不能跑過箭矢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，維多利亞人。這是蔓德拉長官的意思，她允許你在進入倫蒂尼姆之前偶爾有一點自由活動的時間，你最好知道領情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看見你們那座都城的城牆了嗎？它從這裡看還是那麼高大、威嚴、堅不可摧，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多看看，然後記住這種壯麗的幻象吧，等你進了城，你會懷念這些錯覺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們知道倫蒂尼姆裡面發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你過幾天就會親眼見到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，倫蒂尼姆的現狀如何，跟你這個遲早要死的傢伙也沒多少關係了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各、各位，請問這裡離最近的聚落還有多遠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聚落？哈，你是逃出來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別傻了，逃出來的人這麼多，附近的聚落哪裡容得下你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我們是來自遠方的軍隊，女士。這裡我們也並不熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等一下，你是從倫蒂尼姆裡面逃出來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆......現在變成什麼樣子了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你還不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲動手了，倫蒂尼姆已經是他們拿在手裡的玩具了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——沒人知道城防軍去了哪裡，聽說是從內部被瓦解了。沒有人出來保護維多利亞的普通市民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她怎麼知道我要問什麼？深池的士兵又為什麼對這個維多利亞人一反常態地客氣？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其實我也不知道龐大的倫蒂尼姆裡究竟發生了多少事，我已經出城有一段時間了，只是在四處徘徊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那麼倫蒂尼姆外圍呢？這裡聚集著多少貴族的勢力，你是否心裡有數？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是一介小市民該知道的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我甚至也不知道大名鼎鼎的“白狼”伯爵是否在附近。他曾經對我父母有救命之恩，多年來我一直崇敬著他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遺憾，我知道您所說的那個人，但我已經很多年沒聽到過他的名號了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（您認識我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜測他已經和某些貴族合作，在這場紛爭裡站好隊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我猜“白狼”不打算跟別的貴族合作。他更在乎自己的家園，而不是王座的歸屬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，打聽消息到此為止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是尚有軍紀的軍隊，恐怕和你在倫蒂尼姆見過的那些散兵游勇不一樣，女士。趁天黑之前，儘快離開這裡趕路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對不起，我這就離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你們會進入倫蒂尼姆，對嗎？握個手吧，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這是我個人的希望。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——希望你回到倫蒂尼姆之後有機會向我的家人問好。我出逃的時候他們決定留下來，不知道我們還能不能再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們家住在碼頭，你見到我女兒的時候一定會認出她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我會盡力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果我沒有猜錯，她應當......是那位莫寧伯爵的信使。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵，你應該知道我是為什麼來“看望”你的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可憐，你似乎還指望著自己的貴族身份能讓你擁有幾分話語權，透過個人表態來左右其他人的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看過自己現在這個樣子嗎？不知道自己棄子的命運，打了一場徹頭徹尾的敗仗，害死了自己所有的手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就被拔光了獠牙，卻還在叫囂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你這麼惱火，以至於時隔多日又來對我冷嘲熱諷，那就說明你求助的那位貴族拆穿了你的謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我從不會讓領袖失望，所以，你得失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的小聰明和話術什麼也改變不了！他們並不關心你是否真的與深池合作，只要你還活著，他們就會把賭注押在深池這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從你的白日夢裡醒醒吧，絕大多數人可不像你一樣，只想為維多利亞而死。他們只會千方百計地試圖保住自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別擔心，小菲林。至少在為維多利亞而死之前，我一定會先讓你去死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你就這麼喜歡硬撐著，假裝自己還沒有被打倒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就儘管不相信我說的話吧，反正你會慢慢看到事實的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G1_interrogat_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那個維多利亞的瘋子，我們還得看著啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"定時去看一眼就是了，長官說了，要確保她活著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......十九，二十，二十一......再來，三角鐵，重新開始訓練計數......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽，她又開始自言自語了。前段時間還有清醒的時候，現在我們對她說什麼她都聽不進去了，每天只跟死人的影子聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，你去休息吧，該換我值班了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......現在我們假設敵人的編隊中有盾衛和術師，而這裡是投彈手的位置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，長官可是好吃好喝地招待你，沒讓你受一點審訊折磨之類的，這就精神不正常了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難過成這樣，就因為你死了幾個朋友？你想不想知道我們塔拉人失去了多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不知道你這樣的廢物是怎麼在維多利亞的軍隊裡當上......中尉？哈，你的頭銜是這個吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......別亂來，站在我的盾後面。就算你身體素質再好，也不能硬扛爆炸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是一點反應都沒有，算了。繼續和你幻想中的朋友聊天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你自己肯定都不記得了。以前你還說過，自己出任務從來沒失敗過，你的盾總能保護每一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，被我們打成這樣對你來說太恥辱了，所以你就強行把這段經歷忘掉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，長官把你留在這裡，也挺好玩——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這瘋子又在幹什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......人呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天花板上的通風口被拆掉了？......你真以為自己跑得掉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想從通風口走？給我出來，維多利亞佬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是真的以為我瘋了，才敢一個人打開房門試圖抓住我。多謝你的掉以輕心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼......你哪裡來的刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有個熱心人希望我回到倫蒂尼姆之後向她的家人問好，順手給了我一把小型折疊刀。雖然不算武器，但用來拆掉通風口足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順帶一提，這裡的通風管道可不足以讓一個人爬出去，否則我早就走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通訊終端借我一用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你是真的瘋了。你想就這麼從我們基地的最深處大搖大擺地走出去？只拿著一把小刀？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別跑！你要從這裡的窗戶跳下去，是嗎？我不會讓你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攝政王......終於同意見我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，他們確實看到了深池的武力......即使我們雙方都心知肚明，深池和薩卡茲王庭無法真正同盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。領袖當然早就計畫好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——什麼聲音？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人襲擊？但薩卡茲不可能......他們的王明明答應把深池當作客人來招待！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是那些自不量力的維多利亞軍人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，他們總共沒剩多少活人，怎麼會來主動招惹我們？而且倫蒂尼姆的上等人恐怕根本沒見識過深池的火......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g8_jail"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......漂亮的施術，祝你在自己引發的爆炸裡睡得安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是聽夠你說的話了。從你第一次拿他們開玩笑的時候開始，我就打算讓你永遠閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不過你說得對，我可能也不算完全沒瘋。我也不知道一遍又一遍自揭傷疤，究竟是讓我變得更清醒......還是陷得更深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼回事？整幢樓都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是建築內部發生的爆炸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們快帶隊去救人，我去報告長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（周圍的巡邏隊被引向了爆炸發生地，符合計畫。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，本次任務......只有一人參與行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行動方案，從這裡逃出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......備用行動方案，跟深池拼命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何都不會失敗的任務，真讓人感到輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——第二風暴突擊隊隊長號角，出發。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告，蔓德拉長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舊煙草廠發生了爆炸！似乎是通風管道積塵引發的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這有什麼可慌張的，這種小事件你們都不會處理嗎？我以為你們看過不少爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......長官。您應該還記得，那個維多利亞士兵也被關在舊煙草廠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，去爆炸現場進行救援的士兵發現，她似乎......跑掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廢物......你們這些廢物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還說她瘋了？我就知道她是裝的......她哪有那麼容易被打倒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道......薩卡茲不會與我們為敵，倫蒂尼姆的軍隊暫時也想不到我們......只有她，只有這個傢伙會襲擊我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，不過她能跑到哪裡去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g8_jail"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......第三小隊封鎖倉庫附近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼叫沃爾特......今天輪班的守衛不是他嗎？第七小隊，派兩個人在爆炸現場搜尋一下沃爾特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼短的時間，她一定還在這個街區內......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......猜得很對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的封鎖搜查，我無處可逃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這裡沒有其他人。腳步聲從牆那邊過去了，那幾個深池士兵沒看見我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是有人一直在盯著這裡。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她留下了痕跡，應該是往食品加工廠的方向去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要讓她躲進工廠！關上所有的門！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不太巧啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沃爾特已經死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有通訊終端，也被拿走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通訊聲","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關閉守備隊的通訊接入權限！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通訊終端沒聲音了。他們反應過來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡！有人爬上去了！探照燈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去樓頂追！你們從旁邊架弩！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工廠的門，開著？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告，這邊沒有異常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大門——大門怎麼——我剛才明明關上——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來不是深池怠忽職守，打開這扇門的另有其人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"士兵閃身躲到牆後，警惕地環顧四周。工廠陰濕的空氣像是被扼住了喉嚨一樣靜默，讓人感覺不出一絲流動。\n就像風被誰切斷了一樣。\n這不是她第一次感覺到異樣的視線。在那間幽閉的小房間裡，她警覺的神經也曾被挑動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盯著我的人，你是誰？"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒有任何聲音回答她。只有方才路過工廠大門時一閃而過的源石技藝的氣息，讓她確信這裡另有一人在場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——不，他在盯著整個深池看。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是薩卡茲人嗎？是那高居王座之上的意志在審視倫蒂尼姆的亂象嗎？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大門開著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了！她在那裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一隊士兵，正從樓上向下移動，安全通道的門會被立刻撞開。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有至少三名弩手正在瞄準這扇窗外面的平台。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但這裡有無數的管道和集裝箱。我可以耐心地躲藏一段時間，比這些深池的士兵更加耐心。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且深池在讓這家工廠正常運轉，用以補充士兵的日常物資。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（既然這樣，這家工廠就應該還有一個會定時啟用的出口......通往地下層的物流運輸口。我可以找機會打開它。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在構思出逃方案的同時，她聽見大門緩緩打開的聲音從地下傳來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感謝你，不肯露面的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個士兵，就藏在這裡面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在哪裡？你又要逃去哪裡？士兵，你的軍隊已經不復存在了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至走不出這個薩迪恩區哪怕一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你在那些已經被控制的城區冒頭，你就會被魔族流淌源石技藝的刀刃刺穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出來吧，我可是為了你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你出去，你就會看到，大多數不聽話的維多利亞士兵，下場遠比你那支小隊的幾位朋友更淒慘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"順著陰影向運輸口匍匐移動的號角驀地停下了腳步，深池的術師背朝著她，就站在走廊外的燈光底下。\n號角的手裡握著一柄從深池士兵身上奪來的細劍。如果菲林來得及驅動自己的源石技藝，脆弱的劍刃於刺過去的瞬間便會在岩石上折斷。\n但是如果對方沒來得及反應——\n號角握緊劍的同時，蔓德拉朝她的方向轉過頭來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，您也醒著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。剛剛醒來，正好快到我換班站崗的時間了。怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......只是我也恰好沒睡，看到您這邊點起了蠟燭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——抱歉，我打擾您記備忘錄了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，沒有什麼重要的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，我有提起過嗎？我以前就生活在薩迪恩區，住在紡織廠背後的小巷裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家裡習慣在臨街的窗台上留一支蠟燭燃著，因為巷子裡沒有燈，他們想給半夜下工的人們照一下路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝您的燭火，有一瞬間，它讓我感覺......一切都沒那麼灰暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果是以前，我會說念舊不是件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，恐怕只有執著於維多利亞該有的樣子、倫蒂尼姆的市民該有的生活，我們才能在城市的暗處鬥爭下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，雖說是有點不切實際的念想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的。我們相信您，中尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞的軍人沒有那麼容易被打倒......維多利亞的子民都是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不過，我們也都很擔心您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什麼可擔心的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您雖然不願意對我們多說，但我們都是士兵，在許多事情上受的觸動想必是相似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜我代您站崗，您再休息一會兒吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
